{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoosegow: Prison Survival is a choice-based survival game with roguelike elements, where your goal is to survive in a brutal prison environment. Every decision has consequences, every playthrough is unique, and one mistake can cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, you receive a randomly generated inmate with a unique set of stats, a crime, and a sentence. You must balance survival, maintaining your reputation, and achieving the objectives of your chosen game mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME SCENARIOS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic. Survive until the end of your sentence, at any cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career. Climb from the bottom of the prison food chain to the top or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopeless. No matter your rank or status, just try to survive at any cost.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOICE AND CONSEQUENCE SYSTEM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every event offers 2-4 action options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions affect your stats, rank, relationships with inmates, available events and dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items for guaranteed success in critical situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/8c368ade082ddad675929c0fc29d34db.poster.avif?t=1766654104\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/8c368ade082ddad675929c0fc29d34db.webm?t=1766654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/8c368ade082ddad675929c0fc29d34db.mp4?t=1766654104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of items that shape the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic prison vibe \u2014 real slang and traditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability \u2014 no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark humor \u2014 laugh so you don\u2019t cry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/72e2ab5541975e64e8c048ac54bc8d61.poster.avif?t=1766654104\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/72e2ab5541975e64e8c048ac54bc8d61.webm?t=1766654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN INMATE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character\u2019s look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the crime and sentence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your buddy\u2019s personality and quirks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/94f550121a19f87ece84696f5143b81d.poster.avif?t=1766654104\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060640/extras/94f550121a19f87ece84696f5143b81d.webm?t=1766654104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your stats, collect resources, choose your allies. Every decision opens new paths to victory \u2014 or... leads to death.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060640?t=1766654104","ba